      "en": "“Moreover, take up a lamentation for the princes of Israel,",
      "ko": "너는 이스라엘 방백들을 위하여 애가를 지어",
      "source_text_hash": "94b02a790cd907d48ccd435321bffb26613fe497fe0cf767b3e28f736b49515e",
      "translation_text_hash": "97b13bf40eac5989823f77e868335bd7d8481c92e4626c18e62ab4b735cf4a87",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
