      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "EZK",
          "chapter": 19,
          "verse": 3
        }
      ],
      "en": "She brought up one of her cubs. He became a young lion. He learned to catch the prey. He devoured men.",
      "ko": "그 새끼 하나를 키우매 젊은 사자가 되어 식물 움키기를 배워 사람을 삼키매",
      "source_text_hash": "cd52c11b724951dab24a9910a2f378672a0e3a6235d896b0465869adcf1c91ce",
      "translation_text_hash": "a6f80a86c0b9fad6ef0d53af93936e951be6cfdf48adda40c839f44f7f388826",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "그 새끼 하나를 키우매 젊은 사자가 되어 식물 움키기를 배워 사람을 삼키매"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "a6f80a86c0b9fad6ef0d53af93936e951be6cfdf48adda40c839f44f7f388826"
      ]
    },
