      "en": "“‘Now when she saw that she had waited, and her hope was lost, then she took another of her cubs, and made him a young lion.",
      "ko": "암사자가 기다리다가 소망이 끊어진 줄을 알고 그 새끼 하나를 또 취하여 젊은 사자가 되게 하니",
      "source_text_hash": "9a1aca83b12934ee8a1df0a413be4b6412849983d81992f1a52b485f4faecb32",
      "translation_text_hash": "6c6d132d2c06370d6b7daf49389bf9a1319ba21f02494e31cb6e9cd581da86c3",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "암사자가 기다리다가 소망이 끊어진 줄을 알고 그 새끼 하나를 또 취하여 젊은 사자가 되게 하니"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "6c6d132d2c06370d6b7daf49389bf9a1319ba21f02494e31cb6e9cd581da86c3"
      ]
