      "en": "He went up and down among the lions. He became a young lion. He learned to catch the prey. He devoured men.",
      "ko": "젊은 사자가 되매 여러 사자 가운데 왕래하며 식물 움키기를 배워 사람을 삼키며",
      "source_text_hash": "d8bd64f10073611c0637443b9f6755f392d631e4926f8a7a742cc427034c4421",
      "translation_text_hash": "ef2a0892e119b045a8bfcb33602b6eff86ea0809d69de99864bc98a2848f0866",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "젊은 사자가 되매 여러 사자 가운데 왕래하며 식물 움키기를 배워 사람을 삼키며"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "ef2a0892e119b045a8bfcb33602b6eff86ea0809d69de99864bc98a2848f0866"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:EZK:19:7",
      "sequence": 20889,
